thub.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122029#issuecomment-5158725511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122029","id":5158725511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM3vnhw","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T15:02:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T15:36:59Z","body":"Ah, sorry, I used way too specific search keywords while checking the repository. I just took another look and found it. It looks like someone borked the code for this, then:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/eda2a482e9ce82e4056cfffae0ea98c1954605a1/modules/tilemap/editor/tile_map_layer_editor.cpp#L2313\n\nIt's set to the `C` key instead of `H`. I'm not sure what originally happened, but it must definitely be unintended if the shortcut hint shows something different.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158725511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158967585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122029#issuecomment-5158967585","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122029","id":5158967585,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM3-ZIQ","user":{"login":"iker-sr","id":220709788,"node_id":"U_kgDODSfDnA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220709788?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr","html_url":"https://github.com/iker-sr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iker-sr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T15:45:03Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T15:45:03Z","body":"That code doesn't belong to the TileSet Dock; it belongs to the TileMap Dock.\nThis code creates the pop-up menu that I sent a screenshot of earlier, \"Flip Horizontally\" is created with Key::H\n```cpp\nmodules/tilemap/editor/tile_data_editors.cpp:959:\n\tbutton_advanced_menu = memnew(MenuButton);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->set_flat(false);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->set_accessibility_name(TTRC(\"Advanced\"));\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->set_theme_type_variation(\"FlatMenuButton\");\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->set_toggle_mode(true);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->add_item(TTR(\"Reset to default tile shape\"), RESET_TO_DEFAULT_TILE, Key::F);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->add_item(TTR(\"Clear\"), CLEAR_TILE, Key::C);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->add_separator();\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->add_item(TTR(\"Rotate Right\"), ROTATE_RIGHT, Key::R);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->add_item(TTR(\"Rotate Left\"), ROTATE_LEFT, Key::E);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->add_item(TTR(\"Flip Horizontally\"), FLIP_HORIZONTALLY, Key::H);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->add_item(TTR(\"Flip Vertically\"), FLIP_VERTICALLY, Key::V);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->get_popup()->connect(SceneStringName(id_pressed), callable_mp(this, &GenericTilePolygonEditor::_advanced_menu_item_pressed));\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->set_focus_mode(FOCUS_ALL);\n\tbutton_advanced_menu->set_shortcut_context(this);\n\ttoolbar->add_child(button_advanced_menu);\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158967585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5159108029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122029#issuecomment-5159108029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122029","id":5159108029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM4G9vQ","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T16:08:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T16:08:18Z","body":"Sorry, I am definitely tripping LOL.\n\nPersonally, I find it strange the shortcuts are different between the two. But it must have been a while since they were implemented, so that's why the drift occurred, and the `TileSet` editor happened to use the same key for Scene Tree Editor shortcuts. `R` and `E` would also collide with the rotation and scale features of the `Node` editor. I think if it were changed to the shortcuts in the `TileMap` editor (`Z` and `X` are used for rotating tiles there instead), then there would be no chance of colliding.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5159108029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]